@page "/"

<PageTitle>Dashboard - BillFoundry</PageTitle>

<section class="page-header">
    <h1>Dashboard</h1>
    <p class="lede">
        Welcome to BillFoundry. Invoicing features will appear here as they are implemented.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="status-heading">
    <h2 id="status-heading">Application status</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Authentication and account management are available</li>
        <li>Administrators can configure the organization profile under Organization</li>
        <li>Clients can be created, searched, and deactivated</li>
        <li>The service catalog can be created, searched, and deactivated</li>
        <li>Estimates can be created, sent, accepted, declined, expired, duplicated, and converted to invoices</li>
        <li>Invoices can be created, sent, voided, duplicated, and listed with overdue status</li>
        <li>Health checks are at <code>/health</code> and <code>/health/ready</code></li>
        <li>Payment recording and PDF generation have not been added yet</li>
    </ul>
</section>
